<td width="18"></td>
<td width="100%"> We've been busy, raiding every damn day it seems.   We did a Trak thing, we did some more first broods, we took Sontalek off of farm status.   We cleared North ToV again, was probably the most awesome fighting I've seem this guild do.   Killing three flurries at once with only a few chanters/shaman dying is just great.    Clearing Eashan, Aary, Fesh, Dagarn, Lord K, Koi, Lady M, Jorllah and Lady N was fun.<br />
<br />
Having Koi add while doing a Flurry was fun.   Doing seven mobs at once was fun.   Doing Flurry adds while doing named was fun.    Lady Nev even proved to be fun as hell with her annoying ass AE.<br />
<br />
I have the loot somewhere, but still havent posted the loot from last North Clearing and inbetween.<br />
<br />
We did some Rhag lovin,  helped a guild with Doomshade after we killed Rumblecrush, did IV a few times and got many members thier VT shard box to start collecting shards and get a head start on our next big goal, getting VT access.</td>
