<tr>
<td width="18"></td>
<td width="100%"> Well, First off.   Nothing is funnier than watching guilds fight over mobs.    I dont mean race, I mean down right out fight, train, leap.<br />
<br />
Seems one guild killed Statue while another guild whined about wiping out and being trained.   Was funny as hell though - Guild A kills Statue and two adds while other guild licking thier wounds after getting thier asses handed to them.<br />
<br />
While all of that fun was happenening we cleared Sleepers - and all kinds of people were blessed with Prismatics.   Also keyed up two more people today and one of them even got to participate in the ancient bashing.    Other nice things droped as well.<br />
<br />
Us and Hoss (well, a group of em LOL) raced to Zlandicar late tonight - how the hell our goofy asses won is beyond me but we did.   Was fun for both parties.  They never get to race anyone and we were pretty sure they would win.   Zlandicar is easy enough that six people can kill him, but usually there is a cleric in there somewhere.    No chanters, No clerics.   Amazing luck.</td>
